@host = http://localhost:8080

### Prijava demo korisnika
# @name demo
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "demo@dermawise.rs", "password": "demo123"}

### Vraćamo upitnik za rozaceju
PUT {{host}}/api/profile/questionnaire
Authorization: Bearer {{demo.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

< ../service/src/main/resources/questionnaires/rosacea-ppr.json

### BC primer 1: imaRosaceju je dokazano, provenThrough su listovi rekurzivnog upita dokazano (flushing preko tranzijentnog eritema)
GET {{host}}/api/backward/hypotheses/rozaceja
Authorization: Bearer {{demo.response.body.token}}

### Hipoteza akne nije dokazana jer nema komedona
GET {{host}}/api/backward/hypotheses/akne
Authorization: Bearer {{demo.response.body.token}}

### Prijava dermatologa
# @name derm
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "dermatolog@dermawise.rs", "password": "derm123"}

### Dermatolog proverava istu hipotezu za pacijenta
GET {{host}}/api/backward/hypotheses/rozaceja?patientId={{demo.response.body.userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{derm.response.body.token}}
